# Same sample, gap one sample longer than the quiet stretch (1993 > 1992).
# At 4096 the burst is still open, the second pulse arrives inside it, and the
# two pulses become one burst. It ends at the boundary 7168, when the line has
# been quiet 7168 - 4304 = 2864 >= 1993 samples. This case fails if the gap
# test is off by one towards "shorter" (quiet >= gap - 1).
sample two_bursts.sr
period_words 256
pre 100
post 200
gap 1993
burst 1900 2000 4504
